      <span class="glance-icon" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M12 4 21 19H3Z"/><path d="M12 10v4"/><path d="M12 16.6h.01"/></svg>
      </span>
      Challenge
    </dt>
    <dd>Continuous Chromium development at scale, with an insecure, non-scaling build cache</dd>
  </div>
  <div>
    <dt>
      <span class="glance-icon" aria-hidden="true">
