    </dt>
    <dd>Full Chromium builds reduced from ~4.5 hours to ~25 minutes</dd>
  </div>
  <div>
    <dt>
      <span class="glance-icon" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-linecap="round"><circle cx="9" cy="8" r="3"/><path d="M4 19c0-2.8 2.2-5 5-5s5 2.2 5 5"/><circle cx="17" cy="9.2" r="2.3"/><path d="M16.2 19c.4-2 1.7-3.5 3.6-4.1"/></svg>
      </span>
